        dast_intro: 'Enter public site URLs (space-separated, max 10). Results open as an HTML report in a new tab: MDN Observatory grade + response header analysis (HSTS, CSP, cookies, etc.), plus passive domain &amp; port info (DNS + Shodan InternetDB).',
